---
name: jagged-array-values
version: 1.0.0
description: >-
  Feature-request repro: a plain array of arrays of scalars (no objects
  involved at all). Currently rejected by var-file loading with
  ERR_VAL_NESTED_ARRAY_UNSUPPORTED ("nested arrays are not supported"),
  even though every element is a scalar.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - rows
metadata:
  purpose: >-
    Narrowest possible repro of the nested-array var-file restriction,
    isolated from the array-of-objects case in changelog-categories.md.j2.
---
{% for row in rows %}
{% for value in row %}{{ value }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
